# View (`src/view/**`)

- **I4:** Every scroll change has exactly one owner and a named `cause`. Prefer making `cause` a required parameter.
- Guards (L1–L6, FM1–FM2) are defined and enforced in **one** place (**I6**, **L6**). No second filter that re-implements the same rule.
- In V-S, view-dependent behaviour uses transaction annotations — not a second state copy or presentation-in-state.
- Presentation (`source` | `wysiwyg`) must not invent markdown that is invalid in `source` (**I9**).
